* as part of {{m|egy|jrj ꜣbw|{{egy-h|ir-Ab-b-w-D54}}|tr=[[jrj ꜣbw]]|to cease}} and its infinitive {{m|egy|jrt ꜣbw|{{egy-h|ir:t-Ab-b-w-D54}}|tr=[[jrt ꜣbw]]|cessation}}, themselves often negated with {{m|egy|nn}}, {{m|egy|bn}}, {{m|egy|tm}}, etc.

