Sometimes hypothesized to be from a form such as {{inh|egy|afa-pro|*wsɣ}}; compare {{cog|ar|وَسُعَ}}, {{m|ar|وَسِعَ||to be wide}}.<ref>{{R:egy:Loprieno|35}}</ref> Also compare {{cog|tzm|ⵙⵙⵉⵖ|tr=ssiɣ|t=to pass, give, extend, expand}}.

