#*: {{quote|egy|{{egy-h|M17-Z7:f-m-N35:I10-s-G37:A1-N35-M4-t:100-10-M17-Z7:f-Hr-Z1-M42-m-A2-t:X2-X4:Z2-100-100-100:100-100-r-mn:N35-D41:F51-N35-E1-Z1-m-M17-Z7:f-F51:Z2-!H-N35:D36-s-G36:r-M17-N35A-A2-H-q:X1-Hnqt:Z2-d:z-Hnqt-100-r-mn:N35-Y1-m-h-r-Z7-N5-Z1-p:N35}}
