===Etymology 2===

====Particle====
{{egy-part|proclitic|head=x:r-A15}}

# {{lb|egy|with following subjunctive or nonverbal predicate}} [[then]], [[and]] [[then]], [[so]]; {{ng|introduces a subordinate clause describing the inevitable result of an action in a preceding clause}}
# {{lb|egy|with following suffix pronoun/subject and imperfective}} [[must]], [[have to|has to]]; {{ng|introduces a subordinate clause describing a necessity}}
# {{lb|egy|introducing a prepositional phrase}} [[then]]; {{ng|also functions as a converter to allow a prepositional phrase to begin a sentence}}

=====Usage notes=====
In Middle Egyptian this particle is commonly used with a following subject and imperfective to denote necessity but only rarely with a following subjunctive to denote inevitable result.

