# [[lapis]]{{ngd|, its [[blue]] [[color]]}}

====Usage notes====
As with {{m|egy|jrtjw}}, to the extent that ''ḫsbḏ'' ever was used as a color, it was a secondary description and not included in standard colors or symbolism. For at least much of the period of Ancient Egypt, blue was reckoned as a shade of green (i.e. [[grue]]) and listed as {{m|egy|wꜣḏ}}.

