====Alternative forms====
Likely this a variant form of the stative endings {{m|egy|.w}} or {{m|egy|.wy}} or both; see {{m|egy|.w}} for alternative forms.

In Old Egyptian, {{m|egy|.w}}/{{m|egy||.y}} and its variants were used for the masculine plural, while {{m|egy|.tj}} and its variants were used for the feminine plural. By Middle Egyptian, {{m|egy|.w}}/{{m|egy||.y}} had taken on both roles, making plural {{m|egy|.tj}} rare.

In Late Egyptian this form ({{m|egy||.y}}) was also used for the masculine singular.

