===Glyph origin===
Representing a seated man with both arms flexed, the rearward arm overlapping the body, essentially portraying a man in a generic pose to draw little attention to any particular action or quality other than manhood. Compare the Chinese character {{m|mul|人|sc=Hani}}.

{{egy-hiero-color-men}}

