𓉿:
===Glyph origin===
<div>Representing a [[doorleaf]], in the form of a wooden panel with bronze [[flashing]] along one edge, terminating in two cylindrical bronze pins that turned in the hinge. Because this sign was usually accompanied by horizontal signs such as {{m|egy|𓉻}} ({{egy-h|aA}}), it was typically written in a horizontal orientation as well in order to better fill the available space.</div>

===Symbol===
