# {{lb|egy|rare}} {{ng|[[biliteral|Biliteral]] [[phonogram]] for {{m|egy||ꜥꜣ}}.}}
# {{ng|[[logogram|Logogram]] for or [[determinative]] in {{m|egy|ꜥꜣ||doorleaf}}.}}
# {{ng|[[determinative|Determinative]] in words relating to opening something, as in {{m|egy|wn||to open}}, {{m|egy|zn||to open}}.}}

