===Glyph origin===
<div>Showing two strokes, often diagonal {{egy-h|y}} but sometimes vertical {{egy-h|Z1-Z1}}, to represent duality. Compare the Chinese characters {{m|mul|二|sc=Hani}} and {{m|mul|⺀|sc=Hani}}. {{egy-hiero-color|black}} The phonogrammatic value of {{m|egy||j}} is derived from its use as the dual ending, {{m|egy|-j}}.</div>

